# Aegis fix catalog #099 — Jest 28+ with testEnvironment 'jsdom' that is not installed
#
# Tier:       3 · Intermediate
# Category:   test_failure (auto-diagnosed from the log below)
# Engine:     deterministic rule engine — no AI involved
